## 5ct Natural Radiant Cut Diamond Prices

Natural 5ct radiant cut diamonds are GIA-certified earth-mined stones. Every price in this table includes the [Ten Prong Solitaire 14K White Gold](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/ten-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-311235?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) setting at [$860](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/ten-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-311235?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational). These are complete ring prices.

At 5ct, the natural market offers more options and more variation than at 4ct. The G-VS1 entry at [$118,946](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/17278083?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is a genuinely strong stone. The premium tier pushes above [$150,000](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/27574419?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational).

